<http://dbpedia.org/resource/%27Til_There_Was_You> a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "'Til There Was You"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "'Til There Was You is a 1997 American romantic comedy film directed by Scott Winant and starring Jeanne Tripplehorn, Dylan McDermott, and Sarah Jessica Parker. The screenplay, written by Winnie Holzman, traces thirty-odd years in the parallel lives of two people whose intertwined paths finally converge when their mutual interest in a community project brings them together."@en ;
