dbr:Cabin_Boy a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Cabin Boy"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Cabin Boy is a 1994 American fantasy comedy film, directed by Adam Resnick and co-produced by Tim Burton, which starred comedian Chris Elliott. Elliott co-wrote the film with Resnick. Both Elliott and Resnick worked for Late Night with David Letterman in the 1980s as well as co-creating the Fox sitcom Get a Life in the early 1990s."@en ;
