dbr:I%27ll_Do_Anything a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "I'll Do Anything"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "I'll Do Anything is a 1994 American comedy-drama film written and directed by James L. Brooks. While a large part of the film is a satire of the film industry, it also skewers relationships from various angles. Its primary plot concerns a down-on-his-luck actor who suddenly finds himself the sole caretaker of his six-year-old daughter."@en ;
