dbr:Mixed_Nuts a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Mixed Nuts"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Mixed Nuts is a 1994 American Christmas dark comedy film directed by Nora Ephron, based on the 1982 French comedy film Le Père Noël est une ordure. Co-written by Ephron and her sister Delia, the film features an ensemble cast which includes Steve Martin, Madeline Kahn, Rita Wilson, Anthony LaPaglia, Garry Shandling, Rob Reiner, Juliette Lewis, Adam Sandler, and, in his first film role, Liev Schreiber. The film was released theatrically on December 21, 1994, and was both critically and commercially unsuccessful."@en ;
