    rdfs:label "Mute Witness"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Mute Witness is a 1995 horror film written, directed, and produced by Anthony Waller, and starring Alec Guinness, Marina Zudina, and Fay Ripley. Its plot follows a mute American makeup artist working on a slasher film in Moscow, who is pursued by a crime organization making and dealing snuff films after she stumbles upon one of their film sets and witnesses a murder. The film was shot on location in Moscow, while Alec Guinness's scenes were filmed in Germany."@en ;
